I'm CUS-0001. If I convert EUR 200 to USD now, what rate, spread and final USD amount apply to my tier and remaining monthly allowance?&#xD;
&#xD;
&lt;&lt;&lt; request_id=04f71d3b1fa14a16&#xD;
Perfect! Here's your FX quote for converting EUR 200 to USD:&#xD;
&#xD;
**Rate:** 1.086957 (mid rate for EUR/USD)&#xD;
&#xD;
**Spread:** 0% — you have no spread applied at your tier1 level on this conversion&#xD;
&#xD;
**Free allowance:** You have a monthly FX allowance of 500 EUR. You've used 120 EUR of it so far, leaving 380 EUR available. Your 200 EUR conversion falls fully within your remaining allowance, so you enjoy the full mid rate with no spread cost.&#xD;
&#xD;
**Final amount:** **217.39 USD**&#xD;
&#xD;
Your monthly transfer limit also has plenty of headroom — you've spent €1,254.90 of your €50,000 monthly limit, so this conversion won't affect your ability to make other transfers.&#xD;
&#xD;
Is there anything else you'd like to know about this conversion?&#xD;
&#xD;
Tools: tool.get_account, tool.check_limits, tool.quote_fx&#xD;
